  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, combine beef broth, fish sauce, soy sauce, cinnamon stick, and star anise, and bring to a boil over high heat.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add sliced beef brisket to the pot and cook for 5 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "Cook rice noodles according to package instructions and set aside.",
    "Strain the broth and discard the solids.",
    "Add lacquer glaze to the broth and stir to combine.",
    "To assemble the Pho Bo, place cooked noodles in a tagliere vessel, then add sliced beef, green onions, and bean sprouts.",
    "Ladle the hot broth over the top and serve immediately."
